<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
  <title>Aafnokura | Privacy policy</title>
  <script src="https://cdn.tailwindcss.com"></script>
</head>
<body class="min-h-screen bg-stone-50 text-slate-800">
  <header class="border-b border-slate-200 bg-white"><div class="mx-auto flex max-w-3xl items-center justify-between px-5 py-4"><a href="/" class="font-bold text-slate-900">Aafnokura</a><a href="/login" class="text-sm font-medium text-violet-700">Sign in</a></div></header>
  <main class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-5 py-12 sm:py-16">
    <p class="text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-widest text-violet-700">Your account and content</p>
    <h1 class="mt-2 text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight text-slate-900">Privacy policy</h1>
    <p class="mt-3 text-sm text-slate-500">Last updated September 28, 2026</p>
    <div class="mt-9 space-y-8 text-sm leading-7 text-slate-700">
      <section><h2 class="text-lg font-semibold text-slate-900">Information we store</h2><p class="mt-2">Aafnokura stores the name, username, email address, age, and password hash you provide to create an account. It also stores profile photos, posts, comments, likes, and notifications you choose to add.</p></section>
      <section><h2 class="text-lg font-semibold text-slate-900">How information is used</h2><p class="mt-2">Account information is used to sign you in, show your profile, and operate the social features you use.</p></section>
      <section><h2 class="text-lg font-semibold text-slate-900">Content and visibility</h2><p class="mt-2">Posts, comments, likes, and profile details shown in the app may be visible to other signed in users. Do not publish information you want to keep private. Your password is stored as a one way hash and is not displayed in your account.</p></section>
      <section><h2 class="text-lg font-semibold text-slate-900">Storage and security</h2><p class="mt-2">Account and app data are stored in the configured database. Uploaded image files are checked for supported image formats and saved with the associated account or post. We use password hashing, protected sign in cookies, and rate limits for sensitive actions. No online service can guarantee absolute security.</p></section>
      <section><h2 class="text-lg font-semibold text-slate-900">Retention and your choices</h2><p class="mt-2">Your account and content remain stored while the account is active. You can change your profile photo and details, remove posts, or stop using the service. To request account or data deletion, contact the person operating this Aafnokura site.</p></section>
      <section><h2 class="text-lg font-semibold text-slate-900">Contact</h2><p class="mt-2">For privacy questions or data requests, use the contact address provided by the operator of this site.</p></section>
    </div>
    <p class="mt-10 border-t border-slate-200 pt-5 text-xs leading-5 text-slate-500">This policy describes the current features of this application. The site operator should update it with their contact details and any local legal requirements before public launch.</p>
  </main>
</body>
</html>
